    "## Contract elements",
    "- Master service agreement: the overall legal framework of the relationship.",
    "- Service level agreement (SLA): measurable commitments such as availability percentage, response and resolution times, support hours, performance, and the service credits or penalties when targets are missed. Service credits rarely compensate the real business loss, so SLAs are not a substitute for resilience.",
    "- Statement of work: specific services or projects with deliverables.",
