    "- Legal requests: the provider must notify the customer of government or legal demands for its data when legally allowed, and challenge overbroad requests.",
    "- Subcontractors: approval or notification of new subprocessors, and the same obligations flowing down.",
    "- Business continuity and disaster recovery commitments of the provider.",
    "- Liability and indemnification: limits of liability, insurance requirements (including cyber insurance), and indemnities for breaches and intellectual property claims.",
    "- Termination and exit: notice periods, termination for cause or convenience, data portability in standard formats, transition assistance, and deletion certificates.",
    "- Change of terms: how the provider can change the service or the contract, and the customer's options.",
    "- Escrow: source code or data escrow can protect against provider failure for critical software.",
